console.log(result); // Output: "cbb ccc"
</code></pre> 4. 🔁 <code>.replaceAll()</code> — Replace All Matches <ul> <li>Replaces all occurrences of a string or pattern.</li> <li>Regex must use <code>/g</code> (global flag) or it throws a <code>TypeError</code>.</li> </ul> <pre><code>const str = "Carbon emission is increasing day by day.";
