</code></pre> 5. 🔍 <code>.search()</code> — Find Index of First Match <ul> <li>Returns the index of the first match.</li> <li>Similar to <code>.match()</code> but returns a number.</li> </ul> <pre><code>const text = "The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.";
