</code></pre> 6. ✂️ <code>.slice()</code> — Extract a Portion of a String <ul> <li>Extracts part of a string using indices.</li> </ul> <pre><code>const fruits = ["Banana", "Orange", "Lemon", "Apple", "Mango"];
