console.log(text.substr(-6, 6));    // Script
</code></pre> 10. 🔠 <code>.toLowerCase()</code> / <code>.toUpperCase()</code> — Change Case <ul> <li>Converts string to all lowercase or all uppercase.</li> </ul> <pre><code>let greeting = "Hello World";
