console.log(greeting.toUpperCase()); // HELLO WORLD
</code></pre> 11. 🚿 <code>.trim()</code> — Remove Whitespace <ul> <li>Removes whitespace from both ends of a string.</li> </ul> <pre><code>const str = "    TutorialsTonight    ";
console.log(str.trim()); // TutorialsTonight
</code></pre> 12. 🧱 <code>.valueOf()</code> — Get Primitive Value <ul> <li>Returns the primitive string value from a <code>String</code> object.</li> </ul> <pre><code>const str = new String("hello world");
console.log(str.valueOf()); // "hello world"
</code></pre>

